# Title: Suspicious Camera and Microphone Access
# ID: 62120148-6b7a-42be-8b91-271c04e281a3
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Den Iuzvyk
# Date: 2020-06-07
# Tags: attack.collection, attack.t1125, attack.t1123
# Description: Detects Processes accessing the camera and microphone from suspicious folder
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((TargetObject CONTAIN "\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\CapabilityAccessManager\\ConsentStore\\" AND TargetObject CONTAIN "\\NonPackaged")) AND ((TargetObject CONTAIN "microphone" OR TargetObject CONTAIN "webcam")) AND ((TargetObject CONTAIN ":#Windows#Temp#" OR TargetObject CONTAIN ":#$Recycle.bin#" OR TargetObject CONTAIN ":#Temp#" OR TargetObject CONTAIN ":#Users#Public#" OR TargetObject CONTAIN ":#Users#Default#" OR TargetObject CONTAIN ":#Users#Desktop#")))
